# Architecture invariants

Read `AGENTS.md` before adding a page, route, document type, or chart.

- One repo, three portals: client (`/overview`), employee (`/`), and super admin (`/admin`).
- Four bounded contexts: identity, staff, onboarding, documents. Shared model in `src/domains/<ctx>/model.ts`, imported as `@domain/<ctx>/model.ts`; server side in `server/contexts/<ctx>/`. Kernels no context owns (paging) live in `src/domains/shared/`.
- `src/domains/**` is isomorphic: no express, no `postgrest`, no `process.env`, no React, no `localStorage`.
- A service depends on `ports.ts`, never on a table or the environment. Every port has a PostgREST adapter and a memory adapter, and `server/container.ts` is the only file that picks between them.
- Contexts do not read each other's tables. Cross-context reads go through a port the other context satisfies, wired in `container.ts`.
- Express lives in `server/interfaces/http/` and `server/index.ts`. Routers may compose services; services may not know about HTTP.
- Auth is HMAC cookies in `server/contexts/identity/session.ts`, not Supabase Auth. The super admin signs in with `ADMIN_PIN`, not a user row.
- Table `clients_applicatitons` spelling is live. Do not rename it.
- Overview / Holdings / Messages read `src/sample/`. That is illustrative data, not a live ledger.
- `.sample-*` CSS classes style real pages. Do not delete them as leftover demo code.
- Two document systems: KYC in `src/documents/` (localStorage) vs firm PDFs in `src/js/` behind `@domain/documents/agreement.ts`. Do not merge them.
- User-facing strings go in `src/i18n/locales/en.ts`. New colors go in `src/theme/tokens.css`.
- Shared formatters live in `src/lib/format.ts`, not in `src/sample/`.
